{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01923","headline":"杂曲歌辞 春游吟 · 李章","name":"杂曲歌辞 春游吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初春遍芳甸，千里霭盈瞩。\n美人摘新英，步步玩春绿。\n所思杳何处，宛在吴江曲。\n可怜不得共芳菲，日暮归来泪满衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李章","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}